        "message": "ops(deploy): simplify SFTP+pm2 deploy workflow (no manifest, full SCP)\n\nReplaces complex manifest-based deploy with simpler flow:\n- Full SCP of namaweb/ tree to /var/www/namaweb/\n- pm2 reload (no git checkout; SCP files take precedence)\n- Smoke test 14 endpoints with 404 tolerated only on static paths\n\nFaster, simpler, still safe. Requires same GitHub Secrets:\nHETZNER_SSH_KEY, HETZNER_KNOWN_HOSTS, HETZNER_HOST, HETZNER_USER\n\nCo-Authored-By: GitHub Copilot <noreply@github.com>",
