        "message": "ops(deploy): add SFTP+pm2 deploy workflow for Hetzner\n\nAdds deploy-hetzner-sftp.yml that:\n1. Listens on audit/phase-1a-critical-remediation, main, integration/all-epics, feat/waveA-subagent\n2. Resolves live SHA, computes changed-file manifest\n3. Refuses destructive paths (.env, server.js, workflows)\n4. SCPs changed files to ubuntu@204.168.144.74:/var/www/namaweb\n5. SSHes in to checkout HEAD, apply 5 migrations (e47-e51), pm2 reload\n6. Smoke-tests 9 endpoints\n7. Prints rollback command on failure\n\nRequires these GitHub Secrets (set in repo Settings ΓåÆ Secrets):\n- HETZNER_SSH_KEY: contents of C:\\\\Users\\\\ice\\\\.ssh\\\\id_ed25519\n- HETZNER_KNOWN_HOSTS: output of ssh-keyscan -H 204.168.144.74\n- HETZNER_HOST: 204.168.144.74\n- HETZNER_USER: ubuntu\n- DB_PASSWORD: per AGENTS.md / HETZNER_DEVOPS_POSTGRES_GUIDE\n- DB_USER: postgres\n- DB_NAME: n1_db\n\nCo-Authored-By: GitHub Copilot <noreply@github.com>",
